<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-ESS H1 NET PROFIT 4.95 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-ESS H1 NET PROFIT 4.95 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESS, Estonia's leading security company which is seeking a bourse listing, had a net profit of 4.95 million kroons in the first half of 1997, Hoiu Investments said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>This compares to 3.77 million kroons in net profit for the same period last year, it added in a statement.  </p>
<p>Its net turnover was 77.9 million kroons compared to 56.6 million kroons in the first half of last year.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
